CreateDistributionTest
├── when the caller lacks PROPERTY_ISSUER_ROLE
│   └── it should revert with AccessControlUnauthorizedAccount
├── when the contract is paused
│   └── it should revert with EnforcedPause
└── when the caller has PROPERTY_ISSUER_ROLE and contract is not paused
    ├── when the token address is zero
    │   └── it should revert with InvalidToken
    ├── when the merkle root is empty
    │   └── it should revert with InvalidMerkleRoot
    ├── when the amount is zero
    │   └── it should revert with InvalidAmount
    ├── when a distribution already exists for this token
    │   └── it should revert with DistributionAlreadyExists
    ├── when the property is not registered
    │   └── it should revert with PropertyNotRegistered
    ├── when the caller is not the property issuer
    │   └── it should revert with NotPropertyIssuer
    ├── when stablecoin transfer fails
    │   └── it should revert with transfer error
    └── when all parameters are valid
        ├── it should create the distribution with correct data
        ├── it should transfer stablecoin from issuer to contract
        ├── it should calculate and store platform fee
        ├── it should mark distribution as active
        ├── it should set claim deadline
        └── it should emit DistributionCreated event

